        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Bonus points if they end up fighting a foe that takes themselves WAY too seriously–Apostate would be a laugh riot.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Mister Fixer is perfect against Apostate as well. There's nothing quite like Apostate losing his footing because of a grease gun, or being hit in the head by a pipe wrench or tire iron. Wraith's Stun Bolt comes close though. I can just see him convulsing from the current `WHA-AT–THE–HELL–I-IS-TH-I-I-I-IS?!' <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Ahum. I guess that's enough making fun of Apostate for now.</p>",
