        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"LCinn\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lcinn/48/2659_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> LCinn:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mister Fixer is perfect against Apostate as well. There's nothing quite like Apostate losing his footing because of a grease gun, or being hit in the head by a pipe wrench or tire iron. Wraith's Stun Bolt comes close though. I can just see him convulsing from the current `WHA-AT–THE–HELL–I-IS-TH-I-I-I-IS?!' :DAhum. I guess that's enough making fun of Apostate for now.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I can see it now:</p>\n<p>\"Gaze, mortals, into the Orb of Delirium! &nbsp;The abyss awaits you; revel in the glorious ecstasy of your slow, tortured…ow! What was that?\"</p>\n<p>\"… Crowbar.\"</p>\n<p>\"What in the Nine Hells have you done to my orb? &nbsp;No mortal may touch my relics and live! Ow! &nbsp;Stop that!\"</p>\n<p>\"… Mantis style crowbar. &nbsp;Might get me a sammich after this. &nbsp;You done tryin' to take over the world yet?\"</p>\n<p>\"Never! &nbsp;Mankind will kneel to face their ultimate fate! &nbsp;Ow! &nbsp;Stop hitting me with that godforsaken crowbar! &nbsp;Ow!\"</p>\n<p>\"Mmm. &nbsp;Sammich.\"</p>",
